        "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"margin:18px 0; padding:18px; border:1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06); background:#fff;\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:20px;\">Eye Mini Lite Bundles from Elite Sim Golf</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    Turn-key simulator packages built around Uneekor’s <strong>Eye Mini Lite</strong>. Choose your bay size (10ft or 12ft)\n    and your visual tier (Standard, Premium 1080P, or Premium 4K).\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n    <a href=\"#shopify-section-template--19390515511490__main\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:11px 16px; border-radius:999px; background:#086ed3; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">\n      Shop Bundles\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\":[\n    {\n      \"@type\":\"Question\",\n      \"name\":\"What comes in an Eye Mini Lite bundle from Elite Sim Golf?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\":{\n        \"@type\":\"Answer\",\n        \"text\":\"Eye Mini Lite bundles include the Uneekor Eye Mini Lite launch monitor, an Elite Sim Golf enclosure (10ft or 12ft), a BenQ short-throw projector (varies by package), ProTee 5x5 hitting mat, 6x12 landing mat, projector mount, and a projector install kit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\":\"Question\",\n      \"name\":\"Should I choose the 10ft or 12ft package?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\":{\n        \"@type\":\"Answer\",\n        \"text\":\"Choose 10ft if your room is tighter and you want a premium enclosure footprint. Choose 12ft if you want more comfort, easier shared play, and a more immersive full-bay feel.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\":\"Question\",\n      \"name\":\"What is the difference between Standard, Premium 1080P, and Premium 4K packages?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\":{\n        \"@type\":\"Answer\",\n        \"text\":\"Standard is the best-value visual tier. Premium 1080P is a brighter upgrade for real rooms with ambient light. Premium 4K is the sharpest, most premium image experience with maximum course detail and cleaner UI.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\":\"Question\",\n      \"name\":\"Do Eye Mini Lite packages require a PC?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\":{\n        \"@type\":\"Answer\",\n        \"text\":\"Yes. Eye Mini Lite is designed for an indoor simulator setup and requires a compatible PC for software and gameplay.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<!-- ===== Visual Tier Explainer Card (Standard vs Premium 1080P vs Premium 4K) ===== -->\n<div style=\"\n  margin:16px 0;\n  padding:16px 16px;\n  border:1px solid #e6e6e6;\n  border-radius:14px;\n  box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n  background:#ffffff;\n  font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;\n  color:#1f2937;\n\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between;\">\n    <div style=\"min-width:240px; flex:1;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b7280; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 6px;\">\n        Visual Tier Guide\n      </div>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px; font-size:18px; line-height:1.25;\">\n        Standard vs Premium 1080P vs Premium 4K\n      </h3>\n      <p style=\"margin:0; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;\">\n        Same core simulator build—different projector tier. Pick based on room light and how “premium” you want the image to look.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <a href=\"#esg-card-comp\" style=\"\n      display:inline-block;\n      padding:10px 14px;\n      border-radius:999px;\n      border:1px solid #dbeafe;\n      background:#eff6ff;\n      color:#086ed3;\n      text-decoration:none;\n      font-weight:800;\n      font-size:13px;\n      white-space:nowrap;\n      margin-top:2px;\n    \">Compare all 6 →</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:10px; margin-top:12px;\">\n    <!-- Standard -->\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #eef2f7; background:#fafafa; border-radius:12px; padding:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; background:#fff; font-weight:900; font-size:12px;\">\n        Standard\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#374151; line-height:1.55;\">\n        Best value. Built to <strong>get you playing fast</strong> with a bright, golf-friendly image in most garages/bonus rooms.\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#6b7280;\">\n        Best for: budget-smart builds & lower ambient light.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Premium 1080P -->\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #eef2f7; background:#fafafa; border-radius:12px; padding:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #cfe5ff; background:#eff6ff; color:#0b4ea8; font-weight:900; font-size:12px;\">\n        Premium 1080P\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#374151; line-height:1.55;\">\n        Noticeably <strong>brighter and punchier</strong> in real rooms—great if you have any ambient light (garage doors, windows, overhead lights).\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#6b7280;\">\n        Best for: the “most recommended” balance of price + visual pop.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Premium 4K -->\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #eef2f7; background:#fafafa; border-radius:12px; padding:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #cfe5ff; background:#eff6ff; color:#0b4ea8; font-weight:900; font-size:12px;\">\n        Premium 4K\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#374151; line-height:1.55;\">\n        Maximum detail—<strong>sharper text, cleaner UI, and more course clarity</strong>. The “high-end bay” look every time you power on.\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#6b7280;\">\n        Best for: “forever bay” builds and golfers who care about image detail.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#6b7280;\">\n    Tip: If you’re unsure, choose <strong>Premium 1080P</strong> for the biggest real-world visual improvement per dollar. Go <strong>Premium 4K</strong> if you want maximum crispness.\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Mobile stacking -->\n<style>\n  @media (max-width: 860px){\n    .esg-eml-visual-tier-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;}\n  }\n</style>",
