        "custom_liquid": "<!-- =========================================================\nElite Sim Golf — Launch Monitor Comparison Feature (FULL WIDTH)\nEYE MINI LITE vs GolfJoy Spica 3 vs Garmin Approach R50\n========================================================= -->\n\n<div class=\"esg-wrap esg-lm-compare\">\n  <style>\n    .esg-lm-compare{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.6;}\n    .esg-lm-compare *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n    /* IMPORTANT: no max-width container here */\n    .esg-lm-compare .esg-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:18px 18px;margin:16px 0;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .kicker{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b7280;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 6px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .title{font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 6px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .sub{margin:0;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px;}\n    @media (max-width: 900px){.esg-lm-compare .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n    .esg-lm-compare .miniCard{border:1px solid #eef2f7;background:#fafafa;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;background:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .pill.blue{border-color:#cfe5ff;background:#eff6ff;color:#0b4ea8;}\n    .esg-lm-compare h3{margin:10px 0 6px;font-size:15px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare ul{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare li{margin:6px 0;color:#374151;font-size:13px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare a{color:#086ed3;text-decoration:none;}\n    .esg-lm-compare a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .tableWrap{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin-top:12px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background:#fff;min-width:980px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare th,.esg-lm-compare td{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;}\n    .esg-lm-compare th{background:#f8fafc;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;}\n    .esg-lm-compare tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .note{font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;margin:10px 0 0;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .ctaRow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .btn{display:inline-block;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;border:1px solid #dbeafe;text-decoration:none;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .btn.primary{background:#086ed3;border-color:#086ed3;color:#fff;}\n    .esg-lm-compare .btn.ghost{background:#eff6ff;color:#086ed3;}\n  </style>\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"esg-card\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;\">\n      <div style=\"min-width:260px;flex:1;\">\n        <div class=\"kicker\">Launch Monitor Comparison</div>\n        <h2 class=\"title\">Uneekor Eye Mini Lite vs GolfJoy Spica 3 vs Garmin Approach R50</h2>\n        <p class=\"sub\">\n          Three camera-based options, three different “use cases.” Use this guide to pick the right monitor for your sim room,\n          practice style, and how turn-key you want the experience to be.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ctaRow\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n        <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"https://elitesimgolf.com/products/uneekor-eye-mini-lite-launch-monitor\">Shop Eye Mini Lite</a>\n        <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"https://elitesimgolf.com/products/garmin-approach-r50\">Shop Garmin R50</a>\n        <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"https://elitesimgolf.com/products/golfjoy-spica-3-birdie-10-complete-4k-golf-simulator-package\">See Spica 3 Bundle</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Quick take cards -->\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"miniCard\">\n        <span class=\"pill blue\">Uneekor Eye Mini Lite</span>\n        <h3>Best for a dedicated indoor sim bay</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>PC-required</strong> ground unit for a permanent setup</li>\n          <li><strong>Compact hitting zone</strong> for repeatable alignment</li>\n          <li><strong>Club data support</strong> (with included stickers)</li>\n          <li>Great if you want the Uneekor ecosystem + long-term sim room build</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"miniCard\">\n        <span class=\"pill\">GolfJoy Spica 3</span>\n        <h3>Best for portability + “range to sim” flexibility</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Triple high-speed cameras with <strong>built-in touchscreen</strong></li>\n          <li><strong>Indoor & outdoor</strong> use with rechargeable battery</li>\n          <li><strong>No special balls</strong> (works with any ball)</li>\n          <li>Strong option for golfers who want a portable camera unit</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"miniCard\">\n        <span class=\"pill blue\">Garmin Approach R50</span>\n        <h3>Best for premium “all-in-one” convenience</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Large <strong>touchscreen</strong> with an easy on-device workflow</li>\n          <li><strong>Three-camera</strong> system for ball + club measurement</li>\n          <li><strong>Impact video</strong> + training tools + course play (membership required for some content)</li>\n          <li>Ideal if you want a premium, minimal-fuss experience</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"note\">\n      Tip: If you’re building a permanent simulator room, “workflow” matters just as much as data—how you start sessions, switch users, and launch software.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n<div class=\"esg-wrap esg-lm-compare\"></div>\n  <!-- Side-by-side table -->\n  <div class=\"esg-card\">\n    <h2 class=\"title\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Side-by-Side Feature Comparison</h2>\n    <p class=\"sub\">Use this as your quick “what do I gain / give up?” checklist.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"tableWrap\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Feature</th>\n            <th>Uneekor Eye Mini Lite</th>\n            <th>GolfJoy Spica 3</th>\n            <th>Garmin Approach R50</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>Best Use Case</strong></td>\n            <td>Dedicated indoor sim bay</td>\n            <td>Portable practice (indoors + outdoors)</td>\n            <td>Premium all-in-one sim + training</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>Setup Style</strong></td>\n            <td>Ground unit / stationary bay workflow</td>\n            <td>Portable unit you can move session-to-session</td>\n            <td>Device-centric, on-screen workflow</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>PC Requirement</strong></td>\n            <td><span class=\"pill blue\">Yes (PC required)</span></td>\n            <td>Depends on sim/software preference</td>\n            <td><span class=\"pill\">Not required for core use</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>Display / Control</strong></td>\n            <td>Run sessions through Uneekor software on PC</td>\n            <td><strong>Built-in touchscreen</strong></td>\n            <td><strong>Built-in touchscreen</strong></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>Indoor / Outdoor</strong></td>\n            <td>Indoor-focused dedicated setup</td>\n            <td><strong>Indoor & outdoor</strong></td>\n            <td><strong>Indoor & outdoor</strong></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td><strong>“Pick this if…”</strong></td>\n            <td>You want a permanent indoor sim bay and Uneekor workflow</td>\n            <td>You want portability and “range to sim” flexibility</td>\n            <td>You want premium convenience with minimal friction</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"note\">\n      Want us to match the right monitor to your room? Send your ceiling height, room width, and depth and we’ll recommend the cleanest setup.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
